/ A failure reported while nobody waited (the task ended before the wait) is still the answer of a later wait.
Start
- goal.call(Name="Fails", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%task%, Value=%!data%)
- timer.sleep(Duration="500ms")
- task.wait(Task=%task%); on.error(Key="BrokeEarly", Recovery=[goal.call(Name="Caught")])
- assert.equals(Expected="BrokeEarly", Actual=%caught%, Message="a late wait answers the failure")

Fails
- error.throw(Message="it broke before anyone waited", Key="BrokeEarly")

Caught
- variable.set(Name=%caught%, Value=%!error.Key%)
